        "### 5b. Which strata differ, and does the gap change between the two tests?\n",
        "ANOVA alone does not say which strata differ from each other, so Tukey's HSD compares every pair. The domain table shows which skills are most stratified. Because Saber 11 and Saber Pro use different scales, the two moments are compared through standardised (z) scores: the mean z-score of a stratum is its distance from the overall mean in standard deviations.\n",
        "\n",
        "Standardized differences between Strata 6 and 1 are also reported for each domain. These describe gaps within a domain; differences in domain means do not establish equal test difficulty or comparable proficiency."
      ]
